Qt 6.12's `uic` validates promoted-widget class names and rejects the templated
name `AddressableItemList<>` that Cutter 2.5.0 puts in its .ui files:

  BreakpointWidget.ui: Invalid class name: "AddressableItemList<>"

`AddressableItemList` IS a template (with a default argument), so simply
dropping the `<>` makes uic emit `AddressableItemList *member`, which then fails
to compile ("missing template argument list").  Instead, add a concrete alias
for the default instantiation and reference that from the .ui files.  Generated
`ui-><member>` types are unchanged.  Upstream (rizinorg/cutter master as of
2026-10) still has the `<>`, so this must stay a local patch.

Apply in src/: `patch -p1 < cutter-qt6-uic-templated-class-name.patch`

diff --git a/src/dialogs/XrefsDialog.ui b/src/dialogs/XrefsDialog.ui
index 7b3356f..02380de 100644
--- a/src/dialogs/XrefsDialog.ui
+++ b/src/dialogs/XrefsDialog.ui
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@
         <widget class="QuickFilterView" name="toQuickFilter" native="true"/>
        </item>
        <item>
-        <widget class="AddressableItemList&lt;&gt;" name="toTreeWidget">
+        <widget class="AddressableItemListView" name="toTreeWidget">
          <property name="frameShape">
           <enum>QFrame::Shape::Box</enum>
          </property>
@@ -79,7 +79,7 @@
         <widget class="QuickFilterView" name="fromQuickFilter" native="true"/>
        </item>
        <item>
-        <widget class="AddressableItemList&lt;&gt;" name="fromTreeWidget">
+        <widget class="AddressableItemListView" name="fromTreeWidget">
          <property name="frameShape">
           <enum>QFrame::Shape::Box</enum>
          </property>
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@
  </widget>
  <customwidgets>
   <customwidget>
-   <class>AddressableItemList&lt;&gt;</class>
+   <class>AddressableItemListView</class>
    <extends>QTreeView</extends>
    <header>widgets/AddressableItemList.h</header>
    <container>1</container>
diff --git a/src/widgets/AddressableItemList.h b/src/widgets/AddressableItemList.h
index e306699..4c56d9b 100644
--- a/src/widgets/AddressableItemList.h
+++ b/src/widgets/AddressableItemList.h
@@ -116,4 +116,9 @@ private:
     MainWindow *mainWindow = nullptr;
 };
 
+// uic (Qt >= 6.12) rejects a templated promoted-widget class name such as
+// `AddressableItemList<>`.  Provide a concrete, non-templated name for the
+// default instantiation so the .ui files can reference it.
+using AddressableItemListView = AddressableItemList<>;
+
 #endif // ADDRESSABLE_ITEM_LIST_H
